BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-11T03:30:00&endDate=2026-10-11T07:15:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 11 October\, until 0815\, no service between West Drayton and Slough. Replacement bus service W1 operates between Hayes & Harlington and Slough via West Drayton and Langley\, not serving Iver.
